+//   1 byte version || 32 bytes serverPubKey || 32 bytes vtxoTaprootKey
+// The pkScript queried by the Ark indexer is `OP_1 OP_PUSHBYTES_32 <vtxo>`
+// = `5120 || hex(vtxoTaprootKey)`.
